WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.333 --> 00:00:03.875
Yes! One-for-nine, I win!

00:00:05.875 --> 00:00:07.583
Welcome to the party, Kizer

00:00:07.583 --> 00:00:09.333
you must be our newest release

00:00:09.333 --> 00:00:11.250
Uhhh...is this the upside down?

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:18.041
No...it's the upside BROWNS. Muahaha

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:20.208
What can I do for you kids?

00:00:20.291 --> 00:00:22.375
Our friend DeShone Kizer was drafted

00:00:22.375 --> 00:00:23.500
into the upside Browns

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.125
Everything is bad there

00:00:25.333 --> 00:00:26.750
I'm sorry—I'd love to help, but I

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:27.708
got a broken collarbone

00:00:28.291 --> 00:00:29.291
I'm afraid you're on your own

00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:35.875
This place is giving me the creeps

00:00:35.958 --> 00:00:38.000
All these spoiled draft picks...

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:39.291
It's Colt McCoy!

00:00:39.291 --> 00:00:40.875
I'm Cody Kessler, but yeah I get it

00:00:40.875 --> 00:00:43.000
It's got New York, too

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.250
And the Raiders!

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.333
And the Colts!

00:00:45.333 --> 00:00:46.875
Ugh, that's a great sac

00:00:47.083 --> 00:00:48.583
Ahh, great bite though!

00:00:48.583 --> 00:00:51.791
AH! A Spider 2 Y Banana!

00:00:55.791 --> 00:00:58.500
Aaron Rodgers! You came back and saved us!

00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:59.916
I always do (winks)

